title: place_names
---
// Never played. The names of level 1's people and places, declared once so
// a rename is one line here (the names are placeholders: Jon, 2026-11-14).
// A line says a place through its variable, `{$village}`, never by name.
// Signs and room titles take theirs from the names table at the top of the
// level's generator (`generators/intro/make_specs.py`).
<<declare $village = "Hobford">>
<<declare $creator = "Dennis">>
===
